# PXL pipeline scratch (the archival GLB and zone previews are kept)
assets/derived/pxl/dump/

# Phase 4.1 visual-QA output: trace proofs, plate crops, mark masks. 7 MB of
# PNGs, all of it regenerable — `npm run trace` rewrites the proofs and the
# crops come from the scratch measuring scripts beside them. The NUMBERS these
# produced are what matter, and those live in pxlReference.ts and in
# PXL_REFERENCE_QA.md, under test, rather than in an image nobody diffs.
.qa/

# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This project lives in iCloud Drive, and sync
# leaves duplicates named "layout 2.tsx" beside the real file — 29 of them at
# the last count. They are never source, and one of them landing in the repo
# would be a second copy of a component quietly drifting from the first.
#
# The space before the digit is what makes this safe: it matches iCloud's
# naming and not a legitimate "duna61.ts" or "phase2.ts".
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
